      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "The shared multisig-creation helper (`src/rpc/util.cpp`, used by `createmultisig` and `addmultisigaddress`) rejects an `nrequired` below 1 and above the number of supplied keys:\n\n- `nrequired < 1` → `\"a multisignature address must require at least one key to redeem\"`\n- `nrequired > keys` → `\"not enough keys supplied (got N keys, but need at least M to redeem)\"`\n\nThe sibling \">20 keys\" limit is already covered in `rpc_createmultisig.py`, but neither of these two bounds was exercised by any functional test. This adds assertions for both.\n\nRan `test/functional/rpc_createmultisig.py` locally — passes.",
    "labels": [
      {
